WEBVTT

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:08.860
Black Knight...

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:10.990
Orchis...

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.030
I'll have that girl yet.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.580
I wouldn't do that.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:26.330
You'd only get yourself hurt.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:18.740
So everyone's okay?

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:24.200
Yep! All of us, and everyone on the island...
We're all in great shape now!

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:26.370
Are you all right, too, Noa?

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.620
Thank you so much.

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:32.250
It's all thanks to everyone here.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:35.670
So this means that the promise
has been fulfilled.

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.800
What of Gran and Lyria?

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:43.140
They must have landed somewhere in the city.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:47.770
Feel that?

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:48.680
You're right.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:52.650
Someone's using a primal beast's power
somewhere on the island.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:13.000
We should've known.
The empire will never give up on taking you!

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:41.320
It is futile.
You don't stand a chance against me.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:59.210
Surely you know that you're overmatched.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:03.470
If you wish to lose a limb
for the sake of your foolish pride,

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:04.760
I'll oblige you.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.430
I won't let you!

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.890
Please, lend me your power!

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:10.980
Thy name is...

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:13.310
Leviathan!

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:33.290
Orchis...

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:35.170
Do it.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.230
Gran!

00:04:57.100 --> 00:05:01.570
That's enough! I don't want to fight Orchis!

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:06.320
All I want is to be friends with her!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.450
No need.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:11.240
I require only Apollo.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:13.040
I don't want anything else.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.580
<i>Another dead end...</i>

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:55.080
<i>We've got to let Katalina and
the others know right away.</i>

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:58.540
<i>But we can't ask for a primal beast's help.</i>

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:02.090
<i>Or else Orchis will discover where we are.</i>

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:04.550
I knew what was going on.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:11.220
Orchis is with the empire's Black Knight.

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:15.640
So... I knew that this day might come.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.230
But...

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:23.400
I thought that we were alike.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:28.030
Not just the fact that we have the same power...

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:34.240
We also see the same things,
sense them, search for them...

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:41.580
She said she only needs Apollo, right?

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:46.420
She's fighting for someone else's sake.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:50.010
I think I can relate to that.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.550
I won't hand you over.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:57.350
I won't let anyone take away your freedom.

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:59.730
Whether it's the empire or the Black Knight...

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:02.350
I'll fight anyone who tries.

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.230
Gran...

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:08.780
I think it's the same for her, as well.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:13.030
She became like that in order
to protect something, protect someone...

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:20.290
Even though we're the same?
Do I still have to fight her?

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:26.960
Does this mean we can never be friends?

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:55.830
Orchis?

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:02.370
Orchis?

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:05.750
Orchis?

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.880
Orchis? Orchis!

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:17.390
Thank goodness!
You've been asleep for so long!

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:21.730
Are you hurt anywhere? Are you hungry?

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:25.020
Oh, I'm so glad that you're all right!

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:29.070
Who would've thought
something like that would happen?

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.440
But there's nothing to worry about anymore.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:34.410
It's all right. You'll get better in no time.

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:39.540
<i>Orchis... Who's that?</i>

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.750
I'll protect you, no matter what.

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:50.380
<i>Who... are you?</i>

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.600
Welcome, welcome!

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.810
Get your sand brick holders here!

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:11.150
This is the city, Orchis.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:12.570
The market.

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:15.360
Apples.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:17.780
Clothes.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:22.870
Dolls.

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:26.080
Donkey. Buggy.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.520
Ice cream!

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:52.480
Is it cold? Is it sweet?

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:04.250
The sky!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.470
Happy Birthday, Orchis!

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:26.890
I guess that one was bound to be your favorite.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:29.560
You always loved that one best.

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.860
I know. Do you remember this?

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:39.570
When we snuck out of the castle and looked
around the shops together, remember?

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:42.120
- That day...
- I'm sorry.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:49.580
Don't worry. Take your time.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:54.340
I'm sure you'll go back
to being yourself again soon.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.510
Let's just take it a day at a time.

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:00.840
I'm sorry.

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:09.440
Happy Birthday, Apollo.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:13.650
I don't want any more cakes.
Since there's no point in celebrating.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:19.400
You sure haven't changed at all
since then, have you?

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:27.540
<i>I will never leave you alone.</i>

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:32.460
<i>Even if I can never return
to being who you want...</i>

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.170
<i>Who I was before...</i>

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:45.680
<i>I will make your wish come true.</i>

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:50.980
Orchis!

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:53.980
Give it up. Just do as Apollo says.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:58.900
Why are you following the Black Knight's orders?

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:02.820
Since you have the same powers as Lyria,

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:08.580
could it be that you were also a prisoner,
and you're staying there under the empire's orders?

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:15.000
No, I decided on my own
that I would save Apollo, that's why.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:21.170
Thank you for being so nice to me
on the Mist-Shrouded Isle.

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:23.090
It made me happy.

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:26.050
Goodbye.

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:47.660
A ship will be coming to pick us up soon.
Get some rest until then.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:50.370
Why do you do it?

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:55.920
This island, the other islands...
And Lyria, too...

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.960
Trampling all over them!

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.500
Why would you go so far?

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:03.970
How can you go on doing such a thing?

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:08.300
The correct history of the skies...
What does that even mean?!

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:12.730
So you heard that vixen's spiel, eh?

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:17.100
I have my own goals in mind.

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:19.980
I'm here because conditions
serve those goals well enough.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:23.490
The vixen is well aware of that herself.

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.030
Get that through your head, boy.

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:31.290
Freedom, dreams?
I think not.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.330
It's power that wins.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:37.830
If you wish to see something through,
obtaining greater power is the only option.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.170
Gran?

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.510
I won't let you take Lyria!

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:52.350
Do you know what that thing is?

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:56.520
Are your words based on
a genuine understanding of what it is?

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.560
Lyria is Lyria!

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:04.400
She's not a tool for people like you
to use as you see fit!

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:17.580
Gran!

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:20.790
Gran!

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:23.050
Gran! Gran!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:31.010
If you put up no resistance,
neither you nor the boy will come to any harm.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:33.140
That's not good enough.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:39.400
If I give up, then the fact
that Gran held up until now...

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.440
It would have all been meaningless!

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:44.940
Lyria...

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:04.630
Interesting.

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:14.810
Finally caught up to you, Apollonia!

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.960
Gran, are you all right?

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:49.470
It's nothing.

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:52.590
Anyway, how did Eugen...

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.980
Gran!

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:07.610
Are you okay, Gran? And you, Lyria?

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:10.780
We were so worried about you!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.700
Gran! Lyria!

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:26.130
Oh, come on! Going into battle
and getting hurt behind our backs?

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.340
Seriously, don't do it again!

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:29.590
Hey, sorry.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:34.340
That's quite enough.
Both Gran and Lyria are wounded, you know.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:38.720
Don't worry. Katalina and Io's magic
worked really well!

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:43.850
It's fine, just rest.
You can give us a full account later, okay?

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:45.100
You, too, old man!

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:55.160
I'd say... it's his eyes.

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:57.740
They're just like his.

00:16:58.530 --> 00:16:59.660
You're right.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.660
I wonder if it's because they're
gazing toward the same end.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:12.420
On that day, I gave up because I received
Mithra's vow on this island,

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:15.050
but your journey isn't over yet, is it?

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:22.850
Even if I were to go with Rackam and the others,
I'd only slow them down right now.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:27.440
I'll get some rest on the island,
but what about you?

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:30.070
Aren't you going to give them a hand?

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:32.190
Now is not the time.

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:36.030
But once his fate reaches its destination...

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:40.160
He'll likely have an ordeal to overcome.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:55.010
The Proto Reactor and Abandoned Ship link
has been completely severed.

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:58.890
Dark essence has also been extinguished from Golonzo.
All is normal.

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:05.270
Fine. Send all of the data to Agastia,
and have them start analyzing it immediately.

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:05.980
Ma'am!

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:09.480
Transmission received from the Fourth Fleet
of the Crew of Enforcers.

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:11.860
Their mission has been accomplished.

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:15.780
Meaning that all of our objectives have been met.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:23.200
I'm impressed you raised the Girl in Blue so well.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:27.250
Out of respect, I shall entrust her to you
for the time being...

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:30.710
Son of the Primal Killer.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:39.680
Now, then!

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:45.140
Once the supplies you need come in,
I'll have them sent to the Grandcypher, okay?

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:46.640
We're counting on you!

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:50.270
Where will you be heading next?

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.520
Well, we've had a pretty rough time.

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:56.280
I'd like to take it easy for a while...

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:04.030
In the end, what did the empire want
to do on this island?

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:09.210
If they truly wanted to take Lyria,
they'd have resorted to more aggressive methods.

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:14.300
Their objective wasn't just Lyria,
but some kind of experiment as well.

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:15.630
So that's why Noa...

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:26.020
Forcing a primal beast to absorb an entire island's
worth of life energy and go berserk...

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:32.190
That kind of technology is too elaborate
for them to simply end it here.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:35.440
What in the world is the empire trying to do?

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:43.950
Apollonia...
Is that the Black Knight's real name?

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.210
What happened between you and the Black Knight?

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:54.290
Sorry! That story's a mighty long one.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:59.050
But I promise not to make
any trouble for you, Captain!

00:19:59.050 --> 00:19:59.880
But...

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:04.600
Don't give me that scary look!
No need to worry. Okay?

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:06.470
Eugen!

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:13.770
<i>I still haven't gotten him to fully trust in me.</i>

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.320
<i>It's power that wins.</i>

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:20.740
<i>If you wish to see something through,
obtaining greater power is the only option.</i>

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:25.160
<i>I want to believe that it's not all about forcing
someone into submission.</i>

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:25.990
<i>But...</i>

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:33.750
<i>Right now, I don't have enough of what I need
to see this journey through.</i>

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.210
Gran!

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:38.090
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:40.420
We need you! The Grandcypher...

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:46.800
I am Lecia of the Fourth Fleet,
Crew of Enforcers.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:54.810
The other day, the former Supreme Advisor
of the empire, Apollonia Vaar, or the Black Knight,

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:58.190
was arrested for treason
against the Erste Empire on Golonzo.

00:20:58.440 --> 00:20:59.440
Arrested?

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:05.070
By former Supreme Advisor, does that mean
she's been stripped of her rank?

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:14.120
Therefore, we ask that your crew appear as witnesses
on Amalthea Island, where the hearing will take place.

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:16.630
Amalthea Island...

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:20.300
It is the island where we,
the Fourth Fleet, are based.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:23.050
Understood.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.300
We'll go.

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:38.600
Thank you for watching!
